			<div class="content" id="post-content-4825764">
									

<p>Has this idea been done yet?</p>
<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> Joke SCP</p>
<p><strong>Genre (Optional):</strong> Comedy</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> Any anomaly given the designation scp XXXX will undergo a drastic and irreversible personality change. Objects or entities designated scp XXXX will develop an immature, obscene personality, show significant decrease in logical reasoning skills, IQ and ability to make informed decisions and will take every possible opportunity to make obscene 'your mum' or 'thats what she said' jokes. This consciousness manifests in different ways e.g. afflicted computers will display text on a screen, buildings might manifest paint on walls as communication. It is not known how or why this designation produces such effects.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> When an entity with a consciousness was designated scp-XXXX, the researchers involved report a sudden change in personality and IQ in the entity. This was thought to be one of its anomalous properties, until it is discovered to be a manifestation of another scp, and is reclassified. Another anomalous object is given the same designation and this one develops a consciousness of an immature, obscene individual. After the foundation finds out and runs a series of tests with this designation, they designate the scp designation itself as scp-XXXX.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> Jumping on the meta bandwagon- since the designation itself is an scp the designation itself has developed a conscious creating a paradox.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> May be able to use this scp to contain entities that are dangerous because of their superpowered mental faculties, possibly making this a Thaumiel scp.</p>

							</div>

								
					
